{"name":"St. Tropez","hex":"#325482","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"st.","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative letter-case form of St., abbreviation of street."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/st."}],"entries":[{"title":"St. Tropez (self-tan brand)","blocks":[{"text":"St. Tropez is a self-tan brand, specialising in self-tan, skin finishing treatments and bronzing cosmetics. The business was established in 1996. In 2010, it was acquired by PZ Cussons for £62m."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/ST-You-Set-The-Tone-Logo-White-on-Black.png/330px-ST-You-Set-The-Tone-Logo-White-on-Black.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Tropez_(self-tan_brand)","wikidata":"Q7592028"},{"title":"Saint-Tropez","blocks":[{"text":"Saint-Tropez is a commune in the Var department and the region of Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur, Southern France. It is 68 kilometres west of Nice and 100 kilometres east of Marseille, on the French Riviera, of which it is one of the best-known towns. As of 2023, the resident population of the commune was 3,582. The adjacent narrow body of water is the Gulf of Saint-Tropez, stretching to Sainte-Maxime to the north under the Massif des Maures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Saint-Tropez_-_Vue_g%C3%A9n%C3%A9rale%2C_%C3%A9glise%2C_phare.jpg/330px-Saint-Tropez_-_Vue_g%C3%A9n%C3%A9rale%2C_%C3%A9glise%2C_phare.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saint-Tropez","wikidata":"Q1813"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Saint-Tropez-Coat-of-Arms.png/500px-Saint-Tropez-Coat-of-Arms.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Saint-Tropez-Coat-of-Arms.png/1280px-Sain